<h2>Aside 1.7.12</h2>

<p class="intro">Aside gets out of the way of the other app called Aside.</p>

<h3>Naming</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>Fixes a naming conflict with another app called Aside.</b> The app now installs and renames itself as Aside Notes, so the two no longer fight over the same name in your Applications folder. Nothing else changes: same app, same settings, same notes.</li>
